    "吃饭与超市日用分开；衣服鞋包归购物，理发护理、洗衣和订阅单独记，手机膜或手机壳等临时小额支出归零星。分类都可修改。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "吃饭与超市日用分开；衣服鞋包归购物，理发护理、洗衣和订阅单独记，手机膜或手机壳等临时小额支出归零星。分类都可修改。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Separate dining from groceries. Clothes and accessories go under Shopping; care, laundry and subscriptions have their own categories. Small unplanned purchases go under Incidentals. Categories can be changed."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Séparez les repas des courses. Vêtements et accessoires vont dans Achats ; soins, lessive et abonnements ont leurs catégories. Les petits imprévus vont dans Frais divers. Les catégories restent modifiables."
          }
        }
      }
