    "退款、收入或还款不能记作消费。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "退款、收入或还款不能记作消费。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Refunds, income and repayments cannot be recorded as purchases."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les remboursements, revenus et paiements de carte ne sont pas des achats."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "金额带正负号，无法确定收支方向；请单独核对后手动记账。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "金额带正负号，无法确定收支方向；请单独核对后手动记账。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The signed amount is ambiguous. Check it separately and enter it manually."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le signe du montant est ambigu. Vérifiez-le et saisissez-le manuellement."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "同一行有多个金额，无法确定交易金额；请单独手动记账。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "同一行有多个金额，无法确定交易金额；请单独手动记账。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Multiple amounts on one row. Check the purchase and enter it manually."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Plusieurs montants sur une ligne. Vérifiez l’achat et saisissez-le manuellement."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "按图片中的金额行拆分，可能漏行或错配商家。请对照原图核对笔数、日期、金额和收支方向；总额与余额不入账。只支持正向 USD 消费，不能自动换汇。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "按图片中的金额行拆分，可能漏行或错配商家。请对照原图核对笔数、日期、金额和收支方向；总额与余额不入账。只支持正向 USD 消费，不能自动换汇。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Rows are inferred from amounts and may be missed or mismatched. Check counts, dates, amounts and transaction type against the original. Totals and balances are excluded. Only positive USD purchases are supported, without conversion."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les lignes sont déduites des montants et peuvent être omises ou mal associées. Vérifiez leur nombre, date, montant et nature avec l’original. Totaux et soldes sont exclus. Uniquement des dépenses positives en USD, sans conversion."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "请选择 1 至 200 笔消费。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "请选择 1 至 200 笔消费。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Select 1 to 200 purchases."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sélectionnez de 1 à 200 achats."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "发现同日、同商家、同金额的疑似重复消费，请逐笔核对。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "发现同日、同商家、同金额的疑似重复消费，请逐笔核对。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Possible duplicate purchases have matching dates, merchants and amounts. Check each one."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Doublons possibles avec mêmes dates, commerçants et montants. Vérifiez chaque achat."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "检测到其他币种或混合币种。本版仅记 USD，不换汇；请改选仅包含美元消费的截图。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "检测到其他币种或混合币种。本版仅记 USD，不换汇；请改选仅包含美元消费的截图。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Other or mixed currencies detected. Select a screenshot containing only USD purchases. No currency conversion is performed."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Autres devises ou devises mélangées détectées. Sélectionnez une capture contenant uniquement des achats en USD. Aucune conversion."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "检测到退款、冲正或负金额。本版只记录正向消费，不支持退款冲抵；不要将退款记作新支出。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "检测到退款、冲正或负金额。本版只记录正向消费，不支持退款冲抵；不要将退款记作新支出。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Refund, reversal or negative amount detected. Only positive purchases are supported. Do not record a refund as a new purchase."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Remboursement, annulation ou montant négatif détecté. Seuls les achats positifs sont pris en charge. Ne saisissez pas un remboursement comme une nouvelle dépense."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "支付尚未成功，不能记作已发生消费。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "支付尚未成功，不能记作已发生消费。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Payment has not completed and cannot be recorded as a purchase."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Le paiement n’est pas terminé et ne peut pas être enregistré comme achat."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "截图含其他币种，请使用仅包含 USD 的账单。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "截图含其他币种，请使用仅包含 USD 的账单。"
